# CR 304.4: an instant can't enter the battlefield; if one would, it stays in its previous zone. Cryptic Coat cloaks the
# top card of Bot1's library, Lightning Bolt, as a face-down 2/2 creature (CR 701.58a). Oblivion Ring exiles it; when the
# Ring leaves, the exiled card would return to the battlefield (CR 610.3) - face up, as the instant it is - so it stays in
# exile, while the Coat, attached to nothing, stays on the battlefield.
#
# Turn 1: Plains, Sol Ring, Black Lotus for the Coat. Turn 3: Forest, Oblivion Ring (Plains and Sol Ring) on the face-down
# Bolt, not the Coat. Turn 5: Krosan Grip (Forest and Sol Ring) destroys the Ring.

